ter supports USB4 40Gbps or Thunderbolt 4. A regular USB-C port may be much slower.","63":" A PCIe 4.0 NVMe drive is a sensible pairing. Confirm that its physical","60":"Compatibility:","62":"SSD:","59":" A large aluminum heatsink matters during sustained transfers of hundreds of gigabytes."}},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/fallbackMarkdown","o":"replace","v":"# Best USB4 40Gbps NVMe SSD enclosures (November 2026)\n\nAfter searching current listings and independent reviews, my top choices are **OWC Express 1M2 for overall quality**, **UGREEN 40Gbps for value**, and **ZikeDrive Z666 for maximum speed**\\.\n\nOne important distinction: 40Gbps is the interface's advertised bandwidth, not the actual SSD transfer speed. A good USB4 enclosure typically delivers around **3,000\u20133,800 MB/s**, depending on the SSD, computer, and controller.\n\n## Top recommendations\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"OWC Express 1M2 40Gbps USB4 NVMe SSD enclosure silver finned aluminum product\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn556269product14\",\"OWC Express 1M2\"]\ue201\n\n(Best overall)\n\n## \\$99.99\n\nUp to 3,836 MB/s advertised. Large passive aluminum heatsink, silent operation, strong Mac/PC compatibility.\n\nSweetwater\n\n\ue200url\ue202View product\ue202https://www.sweetwater.com/store/detail/EXP1M2--owc-express-1m2-40g-usb4-nvme-ssd-chassis-only?utm_medium=feed&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"UGREEN 40Gbps USB4 NVMe SSD enclosure finned metal housing product\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\nUGREEN 40Gbps M.2 NVMe Enclosure\n\n(Best value)\n\nTypically lower-priced than OWC\n\nStrong independent testing, effective passive cooling, and support for multiple M.2 sizes. Tom's Hardware selected it as its best USB4/Thunderbolt enclosure. \ue200cite\ue202turn556269search6\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn556269product4\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn556269product4\",\"ZikeDrive Z666 USB4 40Gbps NVMe M.2 SSD Enclosure\"]\ue201\n\n(Speed-focused)\n\n## \\$89.99\n\nASM2464PD controller, advertised up to 3,811 MB/s. Tom's Hardware found the ZikeDrive design particularly fast in its USB4 testing. \ue200cite\ue202turn556269search6\ue201\n\nWhatGeek\n\n\ue200url\ue202View product\ue202https://www.whatgeek.com/products/zike-z666-usb4-40gbps-nvme-m-2-ssd-enclosure?utm_campaign=openai_catalog&utm_content=product_card&utm_medium=feed&variant=46911403131133&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn556269product19\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn556269product19\",\"ACASIS TBU406Pro\"]\ue201\n\n(Passive cooling alternative)\n\n## \\$79.00\n\nDeep aluminum cooling fins, fanless design, and 40Gbps interface. Good candidate for sustained workloads without fan noise.\n\nACASIS Electronics\n\n\ue200url\ue202View product\ue202https://www.acasis.com/products/acasis-40gbps-usb4-m-2-nvme-enclosure-with-aluminum-fin-cooling?utm_campaign=openai_catalog&utm_content=product_card&utm_medium=feed&variant=49093588287717&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n## Comparison\n\n| Enclosure | Cooling | Main advantage |\n|--------|--------|--------|\n| OWC Express 1M2 | Passive | Balanced performance and reliability |\n| UGREEN 40Gbps | Passive | Value and good thermals |\n| ZikeDrive Z666 | Passive | High benchmark speeds |\n| ACASIS TBU406Pro | Passive | Deep cooling fins |\n\n## What matters most\n\n- **Controller\\:** Look for ASMedia ASM2464PD if maximum USB4 performance is your priority. Older Intel JHL7440-based designs can be slower.\n- **Cooling\\:** A large aluminum heatsink matters during sustained transfers of hundreds of gigabytes.\n- **Compatibility\\:** Check whether your computer supports USB4 40Gbps or Thunderbolt 4. A regular USB-C port may be much slower.\n- **SSD\\:** A PCIe 4.0 NVMe drive is a sensible pairing. Confirm that its physical"},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls/3","o":"replace","v":"https://www.sweetwater.com/store/detail/EXP1M2--owc-express-1m2-40g-usb4-nvme-ssd-chassis-only?utm_source=chatgpt.com&utm_medium=feed"},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls/4","o":"replace","v":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/3WI3Yjw5g-vXbWU4EyXuff3wbOFPcTFoOP-6iZa351iaTqjqooOCK4_hNeACRTAvPa7b22WxeUvickOIa5dgRqTtHkiLPTjqn33bK0oGYEfMAmxVAfPeedI_EDH_k3fSD8fEsND2QuIFcBT41fKVcw"},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls/5","o":"replace","v":"https://www.sweetwater.com/store/detail/EXP1M2--owc-express-1m2-40g-usb4-nvme-ssd-chassis-only?utm_medium=feed&utm_source=chatgpt.com"},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls/6","o":"replace","v":"https://uk.ugreen.com/products/m2-nvme-ssd-enclosure-40gbps-8tb"},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls/7","o":"replace","v":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/BR4nIXviApkImZjUC-9zGyHqL9EqgoPdbWBtZcfJxEyEEv4qvy6KFOUyPvl4FTGyY5qXU4g0XvosQV-GrPnmyPXyTTG1Wu7xjDjUMtmczOoqBcFwRzyKHFNXh_K3ddyPu8q-t4XmKI7_few5LVeKs36KI09JLJK7WBzZ6THhLZEDTZ1Wa5WIa3_7Y4JsmOZl?purpose=fullsize"},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls/8","o":"replace","v":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/z6Vdm9bDyADSE8JwSM1UliwmEdlDS4LEv0dhej_go-Ln5fnLx3LEmdn_wvy8or6pYjeudi4ROa_5Ha2hE3UpO7LZ-Un4QnXHNJqDQjZkSGWjCEHlnBakvCerGSirFQfpKgcUqP5wuNeZFBoBGcS8hLMJ9Kjob7kN5iMC0_8ccQ4?purpose=inline"},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls/9","o":"replace","v":"https://www.tomshardware.com/best-picks/best-ssd-and-hard-drive-enclosures?utm_source=chatgpt.com"},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls/10","o":"replace","v":"https://www.whatgeek.com/products/zike-z666-usb4-40gbps-nvme-m-2-ssd-enclosure?utm_campaign=openai_catalog&utm_content=product_card&utm_medium=feed&variant=46911403131133&utm_source=chatgpt.com"},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls/11","o":"replace","v":"https://images.ope